  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34674500",
      "title": "Validating Input & Returning Data in action()",
      "lectureOrder": 26,
      "videoOrder": 22,
      "sourceHash": "d410e74055ee02d0a37995aafabac18d0c39175189c3378c066a682e59043428",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.34,
          "end": 4.32,
          "en": "That was the useNavigation hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.32,
          "end": 5.85,
          "en": "and this form component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.85,
          "end": 8.4,
          "en": "which you don't have to use in conjunction but which allow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.4,
          "end": 11.31,
          "en": "you to enhance the user interface if you do so.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.31,
          "end": 14.64,
          "en": "You can't use useNavigation with the regular form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.64,
          "end": 16.59,
          "en": "because there a new request gets sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.59,
          "end": 18.3,
          "en": "and the page is simply reloaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.3,
          "end": 21.27,
          "en": "instead of staying in that single page application world.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.27,
          "end": 24.603,
          "en": "You only do that with this Form with a capital F.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.07,
          "end": 27.6,
          "en": "However, that's not all we can do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.6,
          "end": 30.12,
          "en": "with this action and the form data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.12,
          "end": 33.84,
          "en": "Instead, now I also wanna validate the submitted data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.84,
          "end": 35.91,
          "en": "not some super complex validation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.91,
          "end": 37.593,
          "en": "but at least some validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.67,
          "end": 41.73,
          "en": "And for this here, we could check if in that note data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.73,
          "end": 45.06,
          "en": "which we get, so that form data that was submitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.06,
          "end": 49.89,
          "en": "if there, the title, if we trim it to remove white space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.89,
          "end": 53.73,
          "en": "at the beginning and end, if that has at least a length of,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.73,
          "end": 55.02,
          "en": "let's say, five characters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.02,
          "end": 58.293,
          "en": "to enforce a title length of five characters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.13,
          "end": 61.74,
          "en": "We could also add validation for the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.74,
          "end": 63.93,
          "en": "but here, I wanna keep it simple",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.93,
          "end": 67.293,
          "en": "so I'll just validate the title for this minimum length.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.06,
          "end": 71.03999999999999,
          "en": "Now if this is not met,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.03999999999999,
          "end": 73.77,
          "en": "so actually I wanna check whether it's smaller than five,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.77,
          "end": 77.52,
          "en": "so if it's shorter than five characters, if that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.52,
          "end": 80.16,
          "en": "if we have an invalid title, if it's too short,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.16,
          "end": 82.32,
          "en": "shorter than five characters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.32,
          "end": 85.35300000000001,
          "en": "then we might wanna show an error message to the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.34,
          "end": 89.58,
          "en": "Now you could think about calling the default alert function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.58,
          "end": 91.143,
          "en": "which is offered by browsers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.03999999999999,
          "end": 94.47,
          "en": "However, this wouldn't work here because, keep in mind,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.47,
          "end": 97.74000000000001,
          "en": "that this code runs on the backend on a server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.74000000000001,
          "end": 98.91,
          "en": "not in the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.91,
          "end": 101.25,
          "en": "So you can't use browser APIs here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.25,
          "end": 103.863,
          "en": "you can't use browser only features here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.85,
          "end": 106.95,
          "en": "What we can and should do instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.95,
          "end": 110.28,
          "en": "is that we return a value here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.28,
          "end": 113.58,
          "en": "we do return a redirect here at the end of the action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.58,
          "end": 116.7,
          "en": "Here, I wanna return a different value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 116.7,
          "end": 120.42,
          "en": "And what would that value be that I return here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 120.42,
          "end": 121.77,
          "en": "Well, that's up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 121.77,
          "end": 125.55,
          "en": "Just as you can return any kind of data from a loader.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 125.55,
          "end": 129.21,
          "en": "Here, for example, we could return a message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.21,
          "end": 131.76,
          "en": "where we say invalid title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.76,
          "end": 136.76,
          "en": "must be at least five characters long.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 137.46,
          "end": 138.543,
          "en": "Something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 140.94,
          "end": 145.59,
          "en": "So actions, like loaders, can also return data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.59,
          "end": 148.47,
          "en": "not just redirect responses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148.47,
          "end": 150.87,
          "en": "That's the typical thing you do at the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 150.87,
          "end": 155.19,
          "en": "of a successful action but you can also return data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 155.19,
          "end": 157.82999999999998,
          "en": "But how do you get hold of that data?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 157.82999999999998,
          "end": 160.683,
          "en": "How do you get access to that data?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 161.91,
          "end": 164.91,
          "en": "Well, for that there's another hook which you can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 164.91,
          "end": 167.28300000000002,
          "en": "and that's the useActionData hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 168.69,
          "end": 172.74,
          "en": "This hook, like useLoaderData, gives you access to the data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.74,
          "end": 175.38,
          "en": "in this case returned by an action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 175.38,
          "end": 178.02,
          "en": "So useActionData gives you access to the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.02,
          "end": 179.67000000000002,
          "en": "returned by an action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 179.67000000000002,
          "end": 181.77,
          "en": "useLoaderData, gives you access to the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 181.77,
          "end": 183.033,
          "en": "returned by an loader.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 184.417,
          "end": 188.363,
          "en": "useActionData also must be imported from Remix-run React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 190.11,
          "end": 192.21,
          "en": "Now this data can, again, be anything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 192.21,
          "end": 195.153,
          "en": "in our case, it's an object with a message property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 197.01,
          "end": 200.55,
          "en": "And we can now use that to output the error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 200.55,
          "end": 204.48,
          "en": "We could, for example, pass it to new note as a prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 204.48,
          "end": 206.57999999999998,
          "en": "And then in the new note component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 206.57999999999998,
          "end": 208.113,
          "en": "we could output this error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 209.16,
          "end": 213.66,
          "en": "maybe here above the form or here inside the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 213.66,
          "end": 216.84,
          "en": "Here at the top, we could add a paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 216.84,
          "end": 218.883,
          "en": "where we output the error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 220.17000000000002,
          "end": 223.56,
          "en": "We could, as I mentioned, pass down this data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 223.56,
          "end": 227.43,
          "en": "via a prop to new note, but we don't have to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 227.43,
          "end": 230.22,
          "en": "instead we can remove the useActionData hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 230.22,
          "end": 233.07,
          "en": "from this notes page, so from this Route component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 233.07,
          "end": 236.67000000000002,
          "en": "and remove this import, and instead call it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 236.67000000000002,
          "end": 239.76,
          "en": "in this new note component itself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 239.76,
          "end": 241.23,
          "en": "because that's all's important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 241.23,
          "end": 243.55,
          "en": "useActionData and also useLoaderData",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 244.44,
          "end": 247.41,
          "en": "cannot just be called in these Route components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 247.41,
          "end": 251.67,
          "en": "but in any components and they will get the action or",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 251.67,
          "end": 256.67,
          "en": "loader data of the closest loader or action that was called.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 257.25,
          "end": 259.48,
          "en": "So if I use useLoaderData or useActionData",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 260.79,
          "end": 262.26,
          "en": "in the new note component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 262.26,
          "end": 264.9,
          "en": "and this component was rendered by this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 264.9,
          "end": 266.79,
          "en": "I will get access to the data returned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 266.79,
          "end": 269.673,
          "en": "by the loader or the action of that page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 271.11,
          "end": 273.84000000000003,
          "en": "So therefore here, in the new note JSX file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 273.84000000000003,
          "end": 278.01,
          "en": "I can access useActionData, get my data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 278.01,
          "end": 281.793,
          "en": "and, of course, import that hook from Remix-run React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 284.13,
          "end": 287.463,
          "en": "And now we can leverage that data to output our error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 288.48,
          "end": 292.38,
          "en": "For that, I'll output this paragraph conditionally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 292.38,
          "end": 296.43,
          "en": "and, first of all, check whether data exists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 296.43,
          "end": 299.553,
          "en": "and if it does, whether it has a message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 300.93,
          "end": 305.93,
          "en": "If that's the case, I will output data dot message here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 307.23,
          "end": 309.783,
          "en": "If that's not the case, I won't output anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 310.65,
          "end": 313.863,
          "en": "And this is all default JavaScript JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 315.51,
          "end": 320.51,
          "en": "If we save that and we go back here, and I enter test,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 320.64,
          "end": 323.82,
          "en": "which is too short, and something here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 323.82,
          "end": 326.58,
          "en": "which doesn't matter, and I click add note,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 326.58,
          "end": 329.73,
          "en": "I get my error message here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 329.73,
          "end": 332.673,
          "en": "as expected due to useActionData.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 333.84000000000003,
          "end": 336.72,
          "en": "If I add test note instead, which is long enough,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 336.72,
          "end": 339.72,
          "en": "it is added correctly and the message disappears",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 339.72,
          "end": 342.18,
          "en": "because the action data is cleared thereafter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 342.18,
          "end": 345.42,
          "en": "because the action was called again and succeeded this time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 345.42,
          "end": 349.263,
          "en": "and returned our redirect, instead of my error data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 350.4,
          "end": 352.2,
          "en": "But it is important to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 352.2,
          "end": 354.75,
          "en": "that actions can also return data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 354.75,
          "end": 357.57,
          "en": "that you can get hold of that data with useActionData",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 357.57,
          "end": 360.87,
          "en": "and that useActionData, just like useLoaderData,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 360.87,
          "end": 362.883,
          "en": "can be called in any component.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
